SUB Useitem
SHARED ITEMUSE, LIGHT, GRANADE, SHOVEL, SUIT, KEE, GRINDER, DETECTOR, BOMB
SHARED ORANGE, SUITON, LIGHTON, SND, SWORD
CLS
COLOR 15
